# Architecture & Routing

Follow @.agents/rules/architecture.md.

- App shell: `Layout` wraps view routes; fallback redirect to `/`.
- Responsive navigation:
  - Mobile (≤600px): sticky top header + tabs below.
  - Medium & Large (>600px): left navigation rail, top header hidden.
- Service layer: environment factory pattern for mock and Firebase services.
